{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Bleu Bayou is a compact, fast-paced boss rush featuring a colorful cast of villains and the 8-bit aesthetic of your favorite handheld console.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/num_1_fun.gif?t=1749929219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge four multi-phase bosses, each with unique mechanics and colorful personalities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/Gjzl2A.gif?t=1749929219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hurl your rusty harpoon and trusty machete at your foes, then catch 'em on the rebound to keep the pressure on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/bIGE1p.gif?t=1749929219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Authentic 8-bit style with an original bluegrass-by-way-of-chiptune soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/extras/niYHgk.gif?t=1749929219\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806790?t=1749929219","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806790?t=1749929219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/ba5d81a6043490d102c0f53bd7aacbf1957bec65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749929219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806790/ba5d81a6043490d102c0f53bd7aacbf1957bec65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749929219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descrip